  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consolidating Sea Turtle conservation in the Azores 2 (COSTA2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will assess loggerhead bycatch on longline vessels operating in Azorean waters by placing two observers on 2 LL vessels for 12 months and analyze data with previously collected bycatch data); restructure the turtle tagging activities in cooperation with local partners and expand tagging program with new partners; and continue to distribute a best practices nformation sheet to LL fisherman.</narrative>
  </description>
